 "premise": "A man who wasted his life on Earth is reborn as William and raised in a ruined city of the dead by three undead: the warrior Blood, the priestess Mary and the sorcerer Gus. When he comes of age he defeats an echo of Stagnate, the god of undeath, and vows himself to Gracefeel, goddess of light. He sets out to become a paladin, gathering companions as he goes.",
 "life_message": "A life given in faithful service to a good god and to others is the opposite of a wasted one.",
